{"year":"2025","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 97th Academy Awards ceremony took place on March 2, 2025, at the Dolby Theatre in Hollywood, hosted for the first time by comedian <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 81200, 'screen_type': person}\">Conan O'Brien</a>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1064213, 'screen_type': movie}\">Anora</a> (2024) won five awards, including Best Picture, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 118415, 'screen_type': person}\">Sean Baker</a> became the first person to take home four Oscars in the same night for a single film (picture, director, original screenplay and film editing). <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1000837, 'screen_type': movie}\">I'm Still Here</a> (2024), by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 8574, 'screen_type': person}\">Walter Salles</a>, gave Brazil its first win in the Best International Feature Film category and was also the first Portuguese-language film nominated for Best Picture; <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 87335, 'screen_type': person}\">Fernanda Torres</a> was nominated for Best Actress."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1064213,"name":"Anora","image_path":"/v8Pq2MwPXWDCg1MF3UxNlBCkgDA.jpg","director":"Sean Baker","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":549509,"name":"The Brutalist","image_path":"/52iVP3AtNtpjFiBxlOYCUPXhr47.jpg","director":"Brady Corbet","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661539,"name":"A Complete Unknown","image_path":"/tXNPJ3XvF4RaEV66Qm9QO3pu3w7.jpg","director":"James Mangold","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":974576,"name":"Conclave","image_path":"/7pMyhSbULMkCCOQCInBYU34Qmf3.jpg","director":"Edward Berger","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":693134,"name":"Dune: Part Two","image_path":"/VMy4UGsI2u3f4fALGeCqCdsQBb.jpg","director":"Denis Villeneuve","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":974950,"name":"Emilia Pérez","image_path":"/8ZOvbX3gCZZatUfaIZFFSAdiboW.jpg","direc